{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/pulls/22808", "id": 3032984471, "node_id": "PR_kwDOAhMlZ860x6uX", "html_url": "https://github.com/vaadin/flow/pull/22808", "diff_url": "https://github.com/vaadin/flow/pull/22808.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/vaadin/flow/pull/22808.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/issues/22808", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/pulls/22808/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/pulls/22808/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/issues/22808/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/statuses/357cc4011fb35656eabfc338d21ab5811335089a", "number": 22808, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "fix: stablize tests in AbstractUpdateImportsTest", "user": {"login": "lycoris106", "id": 53146702, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTQ2NzAy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53146702?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106", "html_url": "https://github.com/lycoris106", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## Description\r\n\r\nPart of #22767\r\n\r\nSimilar to PR #22768 and PR #22802, this PR fixes another 2 flaky tests found with Nondex:\r\n\r\n- `AbstractUpdateImportsTest.generateLines_resultingLinesContainsThemeLinesAndExpectedImportsAndCssLinesAndGeneratedImportsAndLoggerReports`\r\n- `AbstractUpdateImportsTest.getModuleLines_multipleFrontendDependencyDoesntExist_throwExceptionAndlogExplanation`\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n- `generateLines_resultingLinesContainsThemeLinesAndExpectedImportsAndCssLinesAndGeneratedImportsAndLoggerReports`: Same as `generateImportsFile_fileContainsThemeLinesAndExpectedImportsAndCssImportLinesAndLogReports` in PR #22802\r\n- `getModuleLines_multipleFrontendDependencyDoesntExist_throwExceptionAndlogExplanation`: Similar to previous one.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n- `generateLines_resultingLinesContainsThemeLinesAndExpectedImportsAndCssLinesAndGeneratedImportsAndLoggerReports`:  Same as `generateImportsFile_fileContainsThemeLinesAndExpectedImportsAndCssImportLinesAndLogReports` in PR #22802 but use Hamcrest.\r\n- `getModuleLines_multipleFrontendDependencyDoesntExist_throwExceptionAndlogExplanation`: Similar to previous one. But to also check the prefix and suffix, the `getFormattedFrontendErrorMessage` utility method is modified to just return the suffix, so we can check with `CoreMatchers.allOf()` separately.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n- All fix in this PR modifies only test code but no Code-Under-Test.\r\n- There are some more flaky tests I will fix in other modules, for which I will open other PRs.\r\n\r\n## Type of change\r\n\r\n- [x] Bugfix\r\n- [ ] Feature\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] I have read the contribution guide: https://vaadin.com/docs/latest/guide/contributing/overview/\r\n- [x] I have added a description following the guideline.\r\n- [x] The issue is created in the corresponding repository and I have referenced it.\r\n- [ ] I have added tests to ensure my change is effective and works as intended.\r\n- [x] New and existing tests are passing locally with my change.\r\n- [x] I have performed self-review and corrected misspellings.\r\n\r\n#### Additional for `Feature` type of change\r\n\r\n- [ ] Enhancement / new feature was discussed in a corresponding GitHub issue and Acceptance Criteria were created.\r\n", "labels": [{"id": 1552389905, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUyMzg5OTA1", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/labels/+0.0.1", "name": "+0.0.1", "description": "", "color": "00dd99", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 2273102701, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwyMjczMTAyNzAx", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vaadin/flow/labels/Contribution", "name": "Contribution", "description": "PRs coming from the community or external to the team", "color": "f4cf90", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:59:56Z", "updated_at": "2025-12-01T11:34:32Z", "closed_at": "2025-12-01T11:34:31Z", "merged_at": "2025-12-01T11:34:31Z", "merge_commit_sha": "ddc03b63b1dd684f48ac2a771fe412c7663f89f5", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "lycoris106:fix-flow-server-flaky-2", "ref": "fix-flow-server-flaky-2", "repo": {"id": 1097502587, "node_id": "R_kgDOQWqPew", "name": "flow", "full_name": "lycoris106/flow", "owner": {"login": "lycoris106", "id": 53146702, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTQ2NzAy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53146702?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106", "html_url": "https://github.com/lycoris106", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lycoris106/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "htt